# For your own local or private builds only. Copy to .env.local (never committed).
# Optional: prefill your relay in Mula (Automation › Claude). Leave empty to type them in the app.
# The token gives full access to your data: never set these for a build you share. Public
# releases (.github/workflows/release.yml) refuse to build when they're set.
EXPO_PUBLIC_MULA_RELAY_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_MULA_RELAY_TOKEN=
